WEBVTT

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:39.110
Shuurei and the others who had arrived at Korin Castle were finally going to meet the patients.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:01.970
This way.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:46.600
Excuse me.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.270
As I thought, it's on the liver.

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:56.650
Where's the boiling water and the strong alcohol that I ordered?!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.030
It's all stored in the room next door.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:04.120
Also, as you requested, we have prepared clean cloths and high quality cotton.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:10.190
Good! Go wash, cut your nails, and scrub your arms with alcohol. Then we'll begin.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.840
Any blockheads who get in the way should be kicked out!

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:18.670
What did you come here for?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:23.720
You-sensei!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:28.180
It looks like we can leave this to You-sensei.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.270
Yes. What about the goods we brought in?

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:31.980
Over here.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.440
We'd better make the rooms warmer.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.150
Is there enough firewood?

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:42.070
We should see to the provisioning of anything that's in short supply...

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.070
Mayor Hei!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.990
I have a little favor to ask of you.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:54.120
Listen. After you wash your hands, never touch your face or head.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.840
All instruments must be placed in boiling water to sterilize them.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:57.790
Yes.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:03:59.170
Doctor You.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.050
The acupuncturists are ready.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:06.050
Acupuncturists from neighboring towns are waiting over there.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.560
Right. We'll start immediately, so bring the closest fellow over here.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.430
Make sure he receives acupuncture precisely as I instructed in my letter.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:13.140
Yes.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:24.740
The acupuncture seems to be working.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.530
The patient is just barely conscious.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:34.960
If the patient sleeps too deeply, his breathing becomes too slow, and his bodily functions slow down too much.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.920
Remember! This is anesthesia by acupuncture.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:40.960
He must receive acupuncture on his forehead too.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:48.100
Remember, even if you were half asleep and half awake, you'd be scared to have your body cut open.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:53.810
If you perform acupuncture on the forehead, it stabilizes the mind and calms the fear.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:56.310
Are the women ready to do the suturing?

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.860
Yes! They are waiting in the room next door.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:03.280
Be careful that the light doesn't move.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.240
Y-Yes!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.780
We're ready.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.870
You endured this well.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.460
Well done. You'll be fine now.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.670
You'll be on your feet soon.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.270
Begin the surgery!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.870
Can we really do it?

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.410
I'm getting worried now.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.420
Don't worry! We practiced it many times.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.290
There's nothing to worry about.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.130
Just think of them like the cows and horses.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.200
Get more water to boil!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:40.960
We'll receive a whole load of dirty instruments and cloths soon.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.590
Be ready to wash and sterilize them at once!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.420
There's enough silk thread, but we haven't got enough cotton.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:52.640
Contact the Treasury immediately and order them to bring more cotton.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.180
Yes.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:59.100
There's not enough firewood, so I've asked old man Hei to collect more from the city.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:06:59.980
Thank you.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.440
How's it going over there?

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:02.690
We're managing.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.980
Oh, I should start preparing meals.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:10.200
Anyone who's not busy, please cook some rice and make rice balls!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.360
Sure.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.490
Ah, and we need more lights for when it gets dark.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.870
Okay, leave the lights to me.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.370
Thanks.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:31.220
The current scalpels won't last long.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.680
There are simply too many patients.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.350
Steel would be best in terms of durability,

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:42.020
but the difficulty is how to combine metals to prevent the iron from rusting.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:49.860
On Mount Ei, there's a silver-white ore that is considered scrap.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.650
Could it be?

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.370
Bring a piece of this ore to me immediately, please!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.660
Sure... As you wish...

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:08.000
This just might be the legendary chromium ore
that allows swordsmiths to create the best steel.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.270
Look, I've removed it.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.070
I've brought them over.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.740
Ah, good.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.030
I'll show you an example first, so watch and learn.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.340
Wow, you're skilled!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.340
This really is same as the cows and horses!

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:53.720
Yeah, something like that.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:55.470
Can you do it?

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.430
I'll try.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.780
I'm impressed. You're much better at this than me.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.790
Seriously, was that all right?

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.080
Compared to you...

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:40.300
Only those who think they can do it should come back.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:46.560
You can't help if you collapse just from cutting open a body.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.730
I'll give you time, so think about it very carefully.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.110
Bring in the next patient and give him the same anesthesia as before.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:57.240
Yes.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.320
I'll continue to do surgery.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.260
I can't do this anymore! Just leave me alone!

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:18.930
Hold on!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.010
Wait!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.140
Let me go!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:27.060
I can't do this! I could never do this!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:29.940
Okay, I nearly fainted a few times too, but...

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:31.810
You mustn't give up!

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.400
We practiced so many times!

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.400
Well then, can you do it?

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.870
To cut open the human body...

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:45.830
So much blood spilled out.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:51.210
I might... kill them.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.340
I can't do it. I don't have the confidence!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:10:59.220
Excuse me...

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.510
Where are the doctors?

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.470
I've come from a village beyond the mountain.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:13.150
The doctors... I heard that there are doctors here who can treat this.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.440
Please save my child... Please!

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.460
Please!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:40.470
I'd give my life to save my child. I beg you!

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.480
I-It'll be all right now.

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:54.310
I'm a doctor.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:02.240
I'm a doctor. I became a doctor to save people.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.740
Now, come with me. We'll save your child.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.870
Thank you very much!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:12.000
Nobody ever said that to me until now.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.800
I can't save anybody if I run.

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.990
Now, ladies, please do the suturing.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.050
Bring medicine!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:02.880
Over here too!

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.010
Acupuncturists as well!

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.900
Well then, just do it!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.650
I'll take all the responsibility!

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:26.740
You-sensei said he'd work all night, so the young doctors are as well.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.830
They said they won't stop before he does.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:34.660
Yeah, but... more and more patients are arriving.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.210
This will take some time to sort out.

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:41.130
True, most of the people who underwent surgery are recovering,

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.510
but many were treated too late.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:14:01.150
The doctors' battle against the disease continued for three days and nights.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:36.810
I'm sorry.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.400
Everybody worked hard with no sleep...

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:43.650
but it was too late.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.610
There's always something beyond your power.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:52.700
At least, more than half the people survived the surgery.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:58.160
True. This is all thanks to You-sensei and the other doctors.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.160
I can tell you this for sure.

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:03.420
There wasn't one failure.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.420
Nobody can do any better than that.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.170
Not even me.

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:11.090
You could call this a miracle.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:15.890
You mean, we actually saved this many lives.

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:16.890
That's the miracle.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.480
Yeah, seriously.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:25.690
I thought I couldn't rely on any of them other than You-sensei.

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:27.940
I'd better apologize to them.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:33.160
Shuuran's mother is still in critical condition,

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:39.160
but she told me tearfully, "Thank you for removing the bad stuff."

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.920
Thank you for your effort, You-sensei.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.670
It's a little too soon to thank me.

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:56.350
Shuurei-jouchan, you're planning to go to Sekiei Village after dawn, aren't you?

00:15:59.180 --> 00:15:59.600
Yes.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:04.770
Fine, leave the kids here, but take me with you.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:08.820
There are villagers who followed Jyasen-kyou, aren't there?

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:09.860
That's right.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:11.610
Please take care of them.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.040
We'd better get some rest.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.410
We're finally venturing into their territory.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:28.380
Jyasen-kyou... I reckon that Senya is probably not the founder.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.630
Yes, probably not.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:34.510
Most likely it's a ruse to lure me to Jyasen-kyou.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:42.930
If Sakujun had anything to do with this,
then I'll send him to hell for sure this time!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.530
Oh, from Sairin-san?

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.990
She worked on them tirelessly.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:59.200
Apparently, they were completed just a moment ago, and she really wanted them given to Doctor You.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.910
They appear to be surgical instruments.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.670
An alloy made of chromium...

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:13.050
It resists heat and rust, and makes the best steel.

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:15.220
Such impressive quality...

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.050
So... what about Sairin-san?

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:22.810
The moment she gave those to me, she must have felt relieved.

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.020
She's dreaming on the sofa now.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:26.310
Is that so?

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:30.520
These will be tremendously helpful! Now, let's go!

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.440
Shuurei-onee-chan!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.780
Shuuran.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.320
You're going to Sekiei Village, right?

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:39.490
Please take me with you!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.740
What? But...

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:44.750
My mom woke up earlier this morning.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.500
The young doctor says she'll be all right now.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.090
Is that so? That's wonderful news.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.760
Yes, so take me with you.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:58.340
It's my village. I'll definitely come in handy, right?

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.010
Oh? But, it could be dangerous.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.020
Riou-kun, tell Shuuran that-

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:06.730
I'm coming too.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:07.850
What?

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:12.400
Well, why not? They really might come in handy.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:18.280
We don't know much about the geography of that area, and there are plenty of things only kids know.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:25.410
All right. We'll go together, Shuuran, Riou-kun.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:41.220
Please leave the rest to my old bones.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:47.890
I pray that you return safely with Governor To.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:56.320
I would like to express my sincere gratitude that you came here to save the people of Korin.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:09.790
Have you finished arranging the restoration of Sekiei Village, Seiran-dono?

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.920
Yes, I'm done.

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:17.210
I made you work really hard this time. You did brilliantly.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:21.180
You must have been concerned about Shuurei-dono.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:24.180
After all, Ensei is beside her.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:29.520
Besides, your wife has gone to the front too.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:34.230
Indeed, normally it's the man who leaves the wife behind.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:40.070
Now, please go. This is the last move before checkmate.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:44.740
Take care of Shuurei-dono and Ensei, at your convenience.

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:46.950
Of course, if it's at my convenience.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:03.180
Apparently, the outbreak of disease down the mountain has been contained.

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:08.390
A woman governor found the cure and rushed over from the capital.

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:13.690
Isn't that great? That seemed to really worry you.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:19.610
Don't use that rotten laugh with that face.

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:21.030
How often do I have to say it?

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:22.400
Oh, what's this?

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:27.580
I heard you were going to perish soon, but you're clinging adamantly to life.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:28.870
Do you understand?

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:33.410
Eigetsu, you're not what we want. Why don't you just die?

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.340
I won't let you order me around.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:40.710
More importantly, just get out of that body.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:44.130
Seriously, how did you find out?

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:50.890
I'm using this carcass properly. I thought I did pretty well.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:52.640
So disappointing.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:54.770
A kid...

00:20:56.650 --> 00:21:00.860
Well, so long as I get that woman, I really don't care.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.360
I used the name "Senya" just for that reason.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:09.160
I understand about Yougetsu,
but why do you want Shuurei-san as well?!

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:14.160
I can understand why they might want Yougetsu.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:17.710
They use similar powers.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:21.880
But... why Shuurei-san?

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:26.880
Dunno. I'm not in a position to know the reason.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:31.470
But I'm glad. It seems the real one is going to show up this time.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:33.220
The real one?

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.100
To tell you the truth,

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:37.690
a stupid follower jumped to the wrong conclusion

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:40.520
and brought in a completely different woman the other day.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.570
He said she was wandering around Sekiei Village.

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.360
Isn't the outside world great?

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:53.580
In our family, all men other than this one guy are treated coldly, so I was surprised.

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:54.830
Family?

00:21:56.080 --> 00:22:00.130
You know that men can't give birth? So we're considered useless.

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:03.090
By tradition, our family heads have mostly been women.

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:04.880
A female family head...

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:06.670
A family with powers...

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:11.970
The Hyou family?!

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:17.560
Seriously, our mother is scary as hell.

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:21.610
I'd love to stay in this world forever, but it's impossible.

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:23.400
I can't run away even if I die.

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:29.200
I'd rather you not even think about running away.

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:32.580
Otherwise, my mother would...

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:36.000
Hey, do you understand?

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:06.320
The person I was waiting for has arrived.

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:12.320
Happy New Year, head of the Hyou family.

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:15.410
I am the present ruler of this country, Shi Ryuuki.

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:17.370
Pleased to meet you.

00:24:45.290 --> 00:24:46.460
We're almost at Sekiei Village.

00:24:47.080 --> 00:24:49.880
Jyasen-kyou is based beyond there, on Mount Ei.

00:24:50.380 --> 00:24:54.260
This is to save the villagers and to bring an end to all disputes.

00:24:54.760 --> 00:24:56.840
Just wait there, so-called Senya!
